%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e67c8174838ec54ba34b1a2dad64db6, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Dialogue:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 623b08a1b5212454491782fa07643ad4, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: So Sonny! What's up with the Hyperian Bionic arm rook??
    _duration: 3
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 84cb4055f45771541a57d38fe19ec79c, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Ah you know! Being human wasn't enough!!
    _duration: 3
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 623b08a1b5212454491782fa07643ad4, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Ha! I'm not surprised. Everyone has Hyperion Corp technology in them
      nowadays.
    _duration: 3
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 84cb4055f45771541a57d38fe19ec79c, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Unfortunately, I did not have the choice to continue life as a average
      human or advance to a cyborg. It was the hand fate dealt me.
    _duration: 4
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 623b08a1b5212454491782fa07643ad4, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: How so?
    _duration: 2
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 84cb4055f45771541a57d38fe19ec79c, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: On a dive near Lunar Keys a few years back, i was looking into reports
      of new species. Near the ocean floor I felt a powerful pull underwater and was
      attacked by something that I'm for damn certain was not from Earth, as it disappeared
      out of thin air.
    _duration: 6
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 623b08a1b5212454491782fa07643ad4, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: 'You mean water? '
    _duration: 3
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 623b08a1b5212454491782fa07643ad4, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Disappeared?? Hmmm. Interesting...
    _duration: 3
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 84cb4055f45771541a57d38fe19ec79c, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Never seen or felt nothing like it doc! But on the greener side the
      new arm is great for kick'n ass and taking names! POW POW!
    _duration: 6
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 623b08a1b5212454491782fa07643ad4, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Calm down now rook, we brought you on board to dive, research, and protect.
    _duration: 6
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 84cb4055f45771541a57d38fe19ec79c, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Wait, protect?!? I am no damn babysitter!
    _duration: 4
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 623b08a1b5212454491782fa07643ad4, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Sonny, we have recently here at Bion discovered some sort of artifact
      60,501 ft below sea level and thats not even the funky part.
    _duration: 3
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 84cb4055f45771541a57d38fe19ec79c, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: I'm listening...
    _duration: 3
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 623b08a1b5212454491782fa07643ad4, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Upon the discovery of Specimen C-777 storms have been brewing and not
      only that. Wormholes in the ocean are popping up at random on our grid.
    _duration: 6
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 84cb4055f45771541a57d38fe19ec79c, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: Where is this "artifact" located?
    _duration: 3
    LoadNextDialogue: 1
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 623b08a1b5212454491782fa07643ad4, type: 2}
    audio: 
    dialogue: 'The lab! Follow me, watch your step and welcome to Bion. '
    _duration: 3
    LoadNextDialogue: 0
